{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっほ〜|ω･)ﾉ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は更新しようと記事を書いてたらそのまま寝ちゃいました。\nごめんね...(ﾉ_･｡)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart03.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はまいやんと美容院行ってきたよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今は髪伸ばしよんけん 前髪をちょっとだけ短くしてもらったて、あとは 痛んでたところを切ってもらって カラーしてキレイにしてもらった☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかなか行けてなくて、でもイベントの前までにはなんとか行きたくて(´･_･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから行けてよかった♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃんっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/09/img_0159.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サラサラなったよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"画像わかりにくいけど、、どうかな(´･ω･｀)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？\nナチュラルブラウンですっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのあとはカフェで語り(･〜･)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッスンに向かいましたー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッスンね、毎日楽しいよっ。\nダンスは今まで習ったことなくて未経験だから 最初の頃はもうどーしようって思ってたけど、毎日のレッスンの中でみさは思いました、ダンスが大好き(`･v･´)ゞ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌も好きやけどダンスも好き♪\n歌いよんときも踊りよんときも楽しい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早くみなさんの前で そんな姿を見てもらえる日が来るように これからもレッスン頑張るっ(`･ω･)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう！！そうなんです！！←\n10日は 全国キャラバン in 福岡！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋、大阪、北海道 そして今回が最後の、福岡です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は 九州・四国メンバーでの参加ということで！\n大分県出身の 衛藤美彩・畠中清羅、長崎県出身の川後陽菜、広島県出身の中本日芽香、和田まあや 。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この5人で、福岡に『はじめまして』のご挨拶に行かせてもらいまーす"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/lovely.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福岡のみなさん！\nおじゃまします＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーい♪♪♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今から楽しみすぎるんやけど！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福岡は小さい時からよく行きよったし、本当大好きや〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福岡は食べ物がほんっとに美味しいんです(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"博多通りもん ←大好き。\n明太子 ←大好き！\nそして 博多ラーメン！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"豚骨ラーメン大好き！！！！\nラーメンといえば豚骨！というくらいの 豚骨派なの〜(´_ゝ｀)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに いつもバリかた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鋼でもいけちゃいます(｀_´)ゞどや\nみんなは何ラーメン派なん？\n教えてー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい、そんな大好きな福岡のみなさんにお会いできるの 本当に楽しみですヽ(・v・)ノ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たーくさんの人に会えるのを楽しみにしています！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10日のイベントのため、福岡には明日上陸っ(=゜ω゜)ﾉ\n朝とてつもなく早いよ〜〜〜。ぴえ〜。\n早起きほんと苦手。。。\n。。気合いで起きます(｀_´)ゞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあまた明日ね\nおやすみ〜っ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写メは、体育座りのいくちゃんとせいらりん(笑)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"を、ぱしゃり"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/shine.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/shine.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/09/img_3049.jpg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}